## 🔹 Overview
**Job Tracker A4** is a job portal web application built using **HTML**, **Tailwind CSS**, and **Vanilla JavaScript**. Users can browse available job listings and apply directly through the platform. The app features a responsive design and dynamic UI updates for smooth interaction.

---

## 🔹 🛠️ Technologies Used
This project is built with the following main technologies:

- **HTML5** — Structure of the web pages  
- **Tailwind CSS** — Utility-first CSS framework for styling  
- **JavaScript (Vanilla)** — Dynamic interactions, event handling  

---

## 🔹 ⭐ Main Features
- 🔹 Browse available job listings with clean UI  
- 🔹 Dynamic rendering of job cards  
- 🔹 Click on a job to view details/apply  
- 🔹 Responsive layout for desktop & mobile  
- 🔹 Interactive UI with JavaScript DOM manipulation  

---

## 🔹 📦 Dependencies
This project does **not** require any external JavaScript libraries or frameworks. It uses:

- Vanilla JavaScript (no React/Angular/Vue)  
- Tailwind CSS for styling *(via local file or CDN)*  

